      "content_body": "When users report intermittent 5xx errors or application crashes, first check pod status for OOMKilled events or repeated restarts. These symptoms often stem from resource exhaustion, race conditions, or downstream dependency failures. Review Deploy Manager logs to identify if specific releases correlate with the instability. If the issue is linked to the Rate Limiter, consider adjusting rate limit thresholds to alleviate pressure on backend services. Escalate to engineering if capacity increases or dependency remediation do not resolve the outage."
